
 Cross over:
   Bullish : if MACD beats signal
   Bearish : if MACD dips Signal
   
 Divergence: Both indicate a cross-over is imminent
   Bullish : negative MACD but losing momentum (color) while price continues dropping 
   Bearish : positive MACD but losing momentum (color) while price continues increasing


 Cheat Code:

   Height of the histogram : Instantaneous speed (delta between MACD line and signal)

   Color of the histogram  : How persistent (trendy) is the speed (darker colors indicate momentum is picking up)

